{"unit_id":"yusufameri__dsh-t3-model-picker#feature-1","repo":"yusufameri/dsh-t3-model-picker","commit":"d3a58dddfb363824c7ba4b2ac0d4fb2089cadaff","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-t3-model-picker** 的功能「模型选择器」：在网页合成器打开模型面板后，可按提供方浏览，也可搜索模型名、描述和提供方；匹配结果按相关度排序并分组显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:511-592"]}
{"unit_id":"yusufameri__dsh-t3-model-picker#feature-2","repo":"yusufameri/dsh-t3-model-picker","commit":"d3a58dddfb363824c7ba4b2ac0d4fb2089cadaff","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-t3-model-picker** 的功能「收藏模型」：在模型行切换星标即可收藏或取消收藏；收藏写入浏览器 localStorage，并可从收藏栏按提供方查看。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:271-317"]}
{"unit_id":"yusufameri__dsh-t3-model-picker#feature-3","repo":"yusufameri/dsh-t3-model-picker","commit":"d3a58dddfb363824c7ba4b2ac0d4fb2089cadaff","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-t3-model-picker** 的功能「键盘快捷键」：使用 Cmd/Ctrl+Shift+M 打开或关闭面板；面板打开时按 Cmd/Ctrl+1 到 9 选择可见列表的对应模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1346-1362"]}
{"unit_id":"yusufameri__dsh-t3-model-picker#feature-4","repo":"yusufameri/dsh-t3-model-picker","commit":"d3a58dddfb363824c7ba4b2ac0d4fb2089cadaff","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-t3-model-picker** 的功能「推理等级」：当当前模型提供推理元数据时，选择器显示推理等级入口，并列出该模型可选等级供切换。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:594-620"]}
{"unit_id":"yusufameri__dsh-t3-model-picker#feature-5","repo":"yusufameri/dsh-t3-model-picker","commit":"d3a58dddfb363824c7ba4b2ac0d4fb2089cadaff","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-t3-model-picker** 的功能「模型可用状态」：选择器读取会话模型目录及可路由提供方列表；未被主机报告为可路由的提供方会标示为不可用。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:330-361"]}
